# oh-my-claudecode / Claude Code tooling state -- operational artifacts from
# building this module, never module source. Found leaked into this
# directory during C6 packaging work (same class of issue a C4 deslop pass
# already cleaned up once); excluded here rather than deleted, since it may
# be a still-active session's own state.
/.omc/

# Local dev-workflow notes for Claude Code. This repo ships publicly; the
# private watchtower-saas repo paths, internal Docker/Warden setup, and
# release-process details in here are not meant to go out with it. Keep
# local-only -- never commit.
/CLAUDE.md

# Output of bin/build-marketplace-release.sh -- generated per release, never
# tracked (the zip is what gets uploaded to Marketplace directly, not stored
# here).
/build/

# Marketplace listing assets (screenshots, copy, install guide) -- these are
# release/marketing deliverables for the Marketplace submission form itself,
# not module source, and are not meant to ship in the module's own zip.
/marketplace-assets/
